#chip 16F1829, 8

'Repeat For test (Change 1654): WaitL1 5 ms in the body (the one-cycle-shorter form behaves the same for milliseconds)
'Expect: compiles, and the whole Repeat For construct runs exactly 200,000 clock cycles
'(checked by simulating the generated assembly instruction by instruction)

#option explicit
Dim X As Byte

Repeat for 100 ms
    WaitL1 5 ms
    X = X + 1
End Repeat
Do
Loop
